<div class="outline-text-3" id="text-org55c0f40">
<p>
Hello, opentelemetry 0.92 was <a href="https://github.com/ocaml-tracing/ocaml-opentelemetry/releases/tag/v0.92">just released</a>. It is an OCaml implementation of the <a href="https://opentelemetry.io/">https://opentelemetry.io/</a> standard for observability. This release improves performance of random generation of trace Ids/span Ids, and adds support for head sampling. We are getting close to a 1.0 release.
</p>

